/td><td><p>Additional heater resistor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024568\">O25A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Additional heater resistor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024570\">O25B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Additional heater resistor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024572\">O25C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the additional heater.</p><p>3. Extract the additional heater.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004700.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the additional heater is not\ndamaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical test.</p><p>1. Fit the additional heater (1a) and engage the retainers (1b)\nin the housings (1c) in the climate control casing.</p><p>2. Tighten the retaining bolts.</p><p>3. Connect the electrical connection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004701.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/302540